# AGP 9.1+ repackages optimized classes into the default package. Kotlin's
# file-facade chain is package-private (for example StringsKt__StringNumberConversionsJVMKt
# extends StringsKt__IndentKt). Moving only the subclass out of kotlin.text makes ART throw
# IllegalAccessError while androidx.startup.InitializationProvider is installing, so the
# process dies before the first activity. Shrinking and renaming inside the original
# package stay enabled; this only opts out of cross-package repackaging.
-dontrepackage
